  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1065500,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "### 15 Years of Friendship (Commodore 64)\n\nEmbark on a heartwarming journey with \"15 Years of Friendship,\" a charming adventure game for the Commodore 64.  Developed by Sandcastle, this title tells the story of a young boy named Timmy and his loyal robotic companion, Robbie, as they navigate a whimsical world threatened by the encroaching Gloom. Fifteen years have passed since Robbie was gifted to Timmy, and their bond is the strongest force against the spreading darkness.\n\nGameplay revolves around puzzle-solving and exploration, utilizing Robbie’s unique abilities to overcome obstacles. Robbie can manipulate objects, activate mechanisms, and even provide Timmy with temporary boosts.  Players must collect scattered fragments of light to restore color and vitality to the land, battling shadowy creatures and unraveling the mystery behind the Gloom’s origin. \n\nFeaturing vibrant, pixel-art graphics and a catchy chiptune soundtrack, \"15 Years of Friendship\" offers a delightful and accessible experience for players of all ages. Discover the power of friendship and restore hope to a world desperately in need of light."
    },
